# Performance Testing in CI

Performance testing в CI — автоматическая проверка что API не деградирует.

## Jenkins Pipeline

```groovy
pipeline {
    agent any
    stages {
        stage('Build') {
            steps {
                sh 'mvn clean package'
            }
        }
        stage('Test') {
            steps {
                sh 'mvn test'
            }
        }
        stage('Performance') {
            steps {
                sh 'jmeter -n -t perf-test.jmx -l results.jtl'
                perfGate resultsFile: 'results.jtl', 
                    p95Threshold: 500, 
                    p99Threshold: 1000,
                    maxThreshold: 3000
            }
        }
    }
    post {
        failure {
            archiveArtifacts artifacts: 'results.jtl'
        }
    }
}
```

