## Perf Gate Logic

```java
public class PerfGateCi {
    public record PerfResult(double p50, double p95, double p99, double max) {}

    public static PerfResult calculate(List<Double> responseTimes) {
        List<Double> sorted = responseTimes.stream().sorted().toList();
        double p50 = percentile(sorted, 50);
        double p95 = percentile(sorted, 95);
        double p99 = percentile(sorted, 99);
        double max = sorted.get(sorted.size() - 1);
        return new PerfResult(p50, p95, p99, max);
    }

    private static double percentile(List<Double> sorted, double p) {
        int index = (int) Math.ceil(p / 100.0 * sorted.size()) - 1;
        return sorted.get(Math.max(0, index));
    }
}
```

## К практике

### calculatePercentiles
Рассчитай percentiles из списка response times.

```java
List<Double> sorted = times.stream().sorted().toList();
double p95 = percentile(sorted, 95);
double p99 = percentile(sorted, 99);
```

### perfGateCi
Проверь что percentiles проходят gate и верни результат.

```java
PerfResult result = calculate(times);
boolean passed = result.p95() < 500 && result.p99() < 1000 && result.max() < 3000;
return Map.of(
    "p95", result.p95(),
    "p99", result.p99(),
    "max", result.max(),
    "passed", passed
);
```

